  "question": "Consider the following nuclear reaction :\n\n$$^{238}\\text{U} \\rightarrow {}^{234}\\text{Th} + {}^{4}\\text{He}$$\n\nTake masses of $^{238}\\text{U}$, $^{234}\\text{Th}$ and $^{4}\\text{He}$ as $238.050$ u, $234.043$ u and $4.003$ u, respectively. The Q value for the reaction, in keV, is :\n\n[Given : $1\\ \\text{u} = 931.5\\ \\text{MeV}\\,c^{-2}$]",
  "diagram": "",
