  "answer": "A",
  "numerical_answer": "",
  "tolerance": "",
  "solution": "Mass defect:\n$$\\Delta m = 238.050 - (234.043 + 4.003) = 0.004\\ \\text{u}$$\n\n$$Q = \\Delta m \\times 931.5\\ \\text{MeV} = 0.004 \\times 931.5 = 3.726\\ \\text{MeV} = 3726\\ \\text{keV}$$",
